# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Clean URLs for Arete Fitness
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Each rule maps a short path to the real file. Status 200 means
# "serve this file" — NOT a redirect. The URL bar keeps the short
# form and the browser is never bounced, so there is no possibility
# of a redirect loop.
#
# Both forms work: /about and /about.html both serve about.html.
# The canonical tag in each page tells search engines the short one
# is the real address, so there is no duplicate-content problem.
#
# This file must sit in the same folder as index.html.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

/individual-sessions    /individual-sessions.html    200
/bundles                /bundles.html                200
/schedule               /schedule.html               200
/about                  /about.html                  200
/contact                /contact.html                200
/book                   /book.html                   200
